  "ruleText": "Gen 405.01 Procedures for, and Effect of, Voluntary Surrender of License. The procedures for, and effect of, the voluntary surrender of a license shall be governed by Plc 205.\n\nSource. #10687, eff 10-7-14; ss by #14338, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35",
